 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-2471) 'After the planning puzzles, can the same temporal plan express a problem that needs only
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2471) 'precedence and durations, with no resources at all?
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2471) '
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-2471) 'Four problem families on the Challenge's list look like a fit by name alone: project-planning
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2471) '(2012, 2015), road_construction (2014, 2017), ship-schedule (2011, 2012, 2014) and
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2471) 'train-scheduling (2024). None of their models has been read yet, so fit is a guess today. The
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2471) 'temporal plan already carries start, end and duration per step, release times and deadlines,
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-2471) 'and a critical-path total, but it has no resources, so any model with a cumulative constraint
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-2471) 'is out of reach before a single model is read.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-2471) '
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-2471) 'Read one family's model in full and classify it: expressible on the temporal plan as is, or
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-2471) 'out of reach because it needs a resource, an all-different, a cumulative or a packing
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-2471) 'constraint the plan does not carry.
