2026-11-07T00:00:17Z (RFD66606-2471) 'MiniZinc Challenge: precedence-scheduling problems on the temporal plan
 # tags: rfd:details-title
 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:18Z (RFD66606-2471) 'Read each of the four candidate families' models, starting with the smallest, and classify
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:19Z (RFD66606-2471) 'each as expressible or out of reach by the same rule the planning puzzles used. For a family
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:20Z (RFD66606-2471) 'that is expressible, climb from its smallest instance, validate every plan against MiniZinc
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:21Z (RFD66606-2471) 'itself, and accept only a plan that is both valid and optimal. A family that needs a resource,
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:22Z (RFD66606-2471) 'an all-different, a cumulative or a packing constraint is set aside rather than forced onto a
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:23Z (RFD66606-2471) 'plan that cannot carry it.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:24Z (RFD66606-2471) '
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

