2026-11-07T00:00:39Z (RFD66606-2471) 'What the temporal plan already carries
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:40Z (RFD66606-2471) 'Start, end and duration per step (an unspecified start and end are left out of a problem; a
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:41Z (RFD66606-2471) 'missing duration means the step is instantaneous), release times and deadlines, and a
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:42Z (RFD66606-2471) 'critical-path total. It carries no resources, so a model with a cumulative constraint cannot
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2471  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:43Z (RFD66606-2471) 'be expressed on it as it stands.
 # tags: rfd:details
